# The dataset corpus is NOT committed. It was ~862 MB and its LFS objects blew
# the GitHub LFS budget, which broke `git clone` mid-checkout and stopped Render
# deploying entirely. It is offline training/eval data — the API never reads it at
# runtime, and dataset discovery returns an empty set when the folder is absent.
#
# Keep a local copy here to run the ml/ pipeline or the corpus-backed tests (they
# skip themselves when it is missing). It must not go back into git: put large
# corpora in object storage or the Hugging Face datasets ml/ already syncs to.
datasets/
*.joblib

